- Frontend rules for interface changes
- Backend rules for model/controller changes
- Security rules for sensitive data

#### Validation Checklist
- [ ] All steps followed in order
- [ ] All relevant rules checked
- [ ] All confirmations received
- [ ] All changes verified
- [ ] Commit message properly formatted
- [ ] No sensitive data included
- [ ] Tests are passing
- [ ] Code review completed if required
